                                "sense_id": "2649eeab-ce92-319b-931c-8e46e7d21eaf",
                                "text": "For as for that conceit of Anaxagoras, of pre and post-existent atoms, endued with all those several forms and qualities of bodies ingenerably and incorruptibly, it was nothing but an adulteration of the genuine Atomical philosophy […]"
